            <div class="step2-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Unique Contribution</h2>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/mandala-1.png">
                <p>The Lover Archetype is all about creating a connection with others through the mastery of their emotions on every level (even those that are hidden from us). When they do this, they experience love in a way that no other archetype will ever know - it&rsquo;s the gift that has been exclusively bestowed onto The Lover.</p>
                <p>In mastering their emotions, The Lover creates a better world simply because they will lead by example emotionally and help others to open up to become more intimate and connected too.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>It&rsquo;s an important role and huge piece of the puzzle that all archetypes contribute to - the puzzle of self-mastery and individuation for all of humanity.</p>
                <p>Most Lovers will already be aware that love, connection, and intimacy are important to them even if they haven&rsquo;t stopped to think about it too much. They might also realize that their focus on such emotional matters, or on the experience of emotion sets them apart from others around them.&nbsp;</p>
                <p><strong>Love Makes the World Go Around</strong></p>
                <p>To the Lover, there is no purpose for living if you can&rsquo;t love and connect. Emotion is a big deal, and even though they&rsquo;ve experienced the highest highs and the lowest lows emotionally, they will be surprised to learn that they are probably only touching the surface in their journey to emotional mastery.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>However, if there was a scale of 1-10 (with ten being the highest) in levels of emotional mastery most lovers unfortunately usually stop around the 4-6 mark.They have never reached their full potential.It&rsquo;s either because they don&rsquo;t realize that there is more to come or they can&rsquo;t face their greatest challenge (more about that later).They may have also imploded due to difficult emotional experiences that they did not manage to deal with in a personally empowering way.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>When you stop to consider this scale and realize that most Lovers don&rsquo;t even know yet what real love is, it&rsquo;s hardly surprising to learn that most Lover Archetypes often feel unloved and unappreciated!</p>
                <p>A sad irony.</p>
                <p><strong>Unfulfilled Emotionally</strong></p>
                <p>Most Lover Archetypes are unfulfilled or superficially filled emotionally. This is because they haven&rsquo;t reached all of the levels of self-mastery that they are unconsciously being called to master.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>In this report, we bring to your awareness of the different emotional levels and experiences that are there waiting for the Lover to embrace.We&rsquo;ll also help you see the blessings that will come your way as a Lover archetype if you can master these levels.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>If you are a Lover, whether you are ready for the challenge, unsure, or prepared to run for the hills emotionally, stay with us as we are about to take you on a journey of personal discovery that will allow you to finally satisfy the depths of your emotional desires beyond your wildest dreams.</p>
                <p>For this is your contribution to the world and the contribution of the word to you as The Lover Archetype</p>
