            <div class="step3-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Sense of Significance</h2>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/sun-glow.png" style="filter:none">
                <p>Attaining a sense of significance is a vital need for everybody.If we don&rsquo;t figure out a way to feel significant, we can start to become stagnant, we might develop poor confidence, and our well-being begins to deplete.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Most people naturally figure out a way to develop their sense of significance, and in the case of The Lover Archetype, they attain their significance by giving and receiving love.</p>
                <p>Finding connection and intimacy with others is incredibly vital for The Lover. To achieve this sense of connection that is so important to The Lover Archetype, they advocate intimacy in all things, and in particular through their self-expression.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>They have no problem opening themselves up to you, which can make you feel comfortable in their company and sets The Lover up to be popular socially and romantically.&nbsp;</p>
                <p><strong>The Perception of Others Feeds the Lover</strong></p>
                <p>The problem is that the Lover gains their sense of contribution not just from expressing love but also (and more importantly) from their perception of how others love them.They need to feel deeply loved and intimate with those around them to be able to place value on themselves and their ability to contribute to the world.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>This problem or perception doesn&rsquo;t serve The Lover well at all because most other archetypes cannot even feel the depth of emotion that a lover does. Let alone demonstrate it to a Lover!&nbsp;</p>
                <p>The absence of love leaves the Lover Archetype in a constant state of lack when it comes to fulfilling their needs, especially when it comes to helping the Lover feel as though they are valid, worthy or even able to contribute to the world.</p>
                <p>Experiencing such a state of lack is a massive problem for the Lover Archetype because it leaves them with no sense of significance.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>And when you have no sense of significance, you won&rsquo;t feel worthy or even worthwhile, and you will inevitably suffer from low confidence and esteem.</p>
                <p><strong>A Double-Edged Sword</strong></p>
                <p>The challenge of finding significance sounds like a harsh proposition for the Lover, but it&rsquo;s important to remember that the Lovers call to action is the mastery of emotion on all levels, including attaining a sense of significance.</p>
                <p>The Lover has a tougher time and a harder challenge in finding significance than most other archetypes.But while the problem of insignificance may be hard for The Lover to master when they do crack the challenge, they will never have a problem with insignificance ever again.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Whereas for other archetypes their sense of significance may not be as hard to find but the glory of their efforts will be less than the Lovers, and they might need to maintain their sense of significance throughout their life.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>When the Lover finds the keys to unlock their potential and master such challenges, they will never have a problem with feeling insignificant ever again.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>The pain and challenges are high for a Lover Archetype, but the rewards they receive for their efforts are probably some of the greatest rewards out of all archetypes.It is worth the effort.&nbsp;</p>
                <p><strong>How A Lover Can Start To Feel Significant</strong></p>
                <p>If you want to know how a Lover can turn their sense of insignificance around and make sure that they are feeling significant, keep on reading on.And check out our Premium reports where we show you how to incorporate shadow work and also other advanced techniques to help you reconcile these challenges.</p>
