            <div class="step5-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Strengths</h2>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/mandala-2.png">
                <p>The Lover has many strengths and weaknesses. Some will be classic Lover traits. Others will be unique to each person. This list is just an example of some of the strengths and weaknesses that a Lover may show or experience.</p>
                <p><strong>Understands And Relates To People From All Sorts Of Backgrounds</strong></p>
                <p>If there is anyone who understands people from all walks of life, it’s the Lover Archetype.  It doesn’t matter if they have experienced similar experiences as others or not, the Lovers emotional and social awareness leads them to understand what another person might be feeling.</p>
                <p>And the Lovers desire to make a connection allows the Lover to reach out and let the person they are focused on understand that they ‘see’ them, and they can relate to the emotion that they might be feeling inside.</p>
                <p><strong>The Lover Spreads The Joy That The Finer Things Bring</strong></p>
                <p>The Lover Archetype pays attention to the finer things in life. They appreciate the joy that even the smallest things can bring.  They love anything sensual and delight in sharing that joy with others, which in turn brings delight to the people around them.</p>
                <p><strong>Committed and Invested In Relationships</strong></p>
                <p>The Lover Archetype probably makes one of the best Lovers and romantic partners out of all of the Archetypes.  Not just because they are driven and focused on expressing and receiving that emotional connection but also because when they are in a relationship, they are totally committed and invested. </p>
                <p>It will be of extreme importance to a Lover archetype that they find a way to make a strong and intimate connection with their partner.</p>
                <p><strong>Wears Their Heart On Their Sleeve</strong></p>
                <p>A Lover Archetype always wears their heart on their sleeve.  If you are around a Lover, you’ll be likely to know how they feel most of the time because they’ll tell you.  Some people might think that this emotional display is far too open, but for the Lover, it’s a completely reasonable way to be. Moreover, they’ll probably spend time wondering why some people are not more honest about how they are feeling! </p>
                <p>With that said, the emotions that a Lover expresses are only the emotions they acknowledge and recognize.  Some parts of the Lover Archetype remain secret to even them, waiting to be uncovered and brought into the light of day.  It’s crucial that a Lover learn how to do this so that they can find the best version of themselves.</p>
                <p>Lovers can find the best version of themselves through shadow work, which is discussed in more detail at the end of this report.</p>
                <p><strong>Kind and Generous</strong></p>
                <p>Lover Archetypes, most of the time, are kind and generous to a fault.  They are the loveable lions who are always ready to share some love and generosity with anybody who wants to share their passion with them.  This tendency makes them extraordinarily kind and generous to those around them.</p>
                <p>Such kindness is one of the ways that the Lover has learned to express their emotions to others. However, they can come across as being a little too vulnerable or showy which can lead to issues around being rejected or taken for granted.</p>
                <p><strong>Exudes Charisma</strong></p>
                <p>The Lover, whether they intend to or not, are always charming.  Their charisma often drips from them, which means that people gravitate toward them seemingly without any effort on the Lover’s part.</p>
                <p><strong>Idealistic</strong></p>
                <p>Lover archetypes in their need to seek emotional fulfillment can be somewhat idealistic about most things that they deem to be important to them, and in some cases, this is not such an advantage.  But when it comes to creating special moments, the Lover is unlimited with their creativity.</p>
                <p>The efforts that The Lover might go too to bring their ideas into reality is endless.  It's a wonderful quality that brings much joy, fun, and inspiration to those around the Lover and who receive the benefits of these efforts.  However, it can leave the Lover vulnerable because their idealistic tendencies can be a weakness too - there’s more on that coming up.</p>
                
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Weaknesses</h2>
                <p><strong>They Give Way More Than They Recieve</strong></p>
                <p>Unfortunately, a Lover Archetype can give way more than they receive and sometimes to people who take from The Lover but don’t appreciate them at all.</p>
                <p>Others can manipulate The lover's unlimited efforts to make an emotional connection for their gain, and when this occurs and if the Lover notices the hurt and rejection that the Lover will feel will usually cut deep.  Because when the Lover gives like this, it’s one of the ways that they can give their best expression of themselves.</p>
                <p>The Lover gives all of themselves in this process, and when they are rejected (or taken advantage of) when they have invested so much love to others, it can hurt.</p>
                <p><strong>Lacks In Self Belief</strong></p>
                <p>One of the driving forces behind many of The Lovers actions is that they lack greatly in self-belief, and if left unreconciled this can compound into low confidence and subsequent problems that arise from experiencing such low confidence.</p>
                <p><strong>Often Feels Unappreciated In Close Relationships</strong></p>
                <p>Lovers give to others in a close relationship in the way that they’d like to receive.  That’s not to say that they give to receive but that they give to the endless levels that they can take love because that’s what they think the person they love needs (it’s certainly what the Lover ‘needs’). The Lover has a huge appetite for the intense emotions that connection and intimacy brings.</p>
                <p>Unfortunately, the Lover’s appetite is so intense that there are not many who can keep the Lover feeling full emotionally.</p>
                <p>This leads to the Lover feeling as though they are unappreciated, misunderstood, or not loved as much.  The Lover needs to learn that people show love in different ways and even though they may not demonstrate love to the same extent that the Lover does it doesn’t mean that they are not loved.</p>
                <p><strong>Can Manipulate To Get What They Want</strong></p>
                <p>Because a Lover often lacks in their sense of self and self-esteem, they find it difficult to handle rejection.  This means that in some cases they might manipulate to gain acceptance.  In other cases, they are so sociable and charismatic that they can ‘create,’ or shall we say manipulate circumstances to suit themselves just because they can, and even out of habit!</p>
                <p><strong>Can&rsquo;t Handle Rejection</strong></p>
                <p>If a Lover receives rejection or perceives that they are being rejected, they can fall apart inside in a heartbeat, even if you cannot see them doing so outwardly.</p>
                <p>Rejection is the enemy of the Lover archetype and also the Lover’s greatest teacher.  It’s just that the lessons that rejection has to teach the Lover are tough for the Lover to master.</p>
                <p><strong>Can Seek Superficial Relationships Just To Feel Loved, Or Avoid Being Alone</strong></p>
                <p>Because a Lover has such a tough time with their sense of security and esteem, they can become superficial in their approach to relationships - seeking them out so that they can have a taste of ‘love’ or intimacy - or avoid having to be alone with themselves.</p>
                <p>It’s sad to see a Lover this way, especially since this process is the same process that somebody would go through if they were addicted to something.</p>
                <p>Problems can occur if the Lover has taken enough rejection that they shut down and almost withdraw, so they only end up giving a small percentage of their love to others. </p>
                <p>If this occurs, the Lover will feel desperately unhappy inside and needs to address this issue so that they can find the love and intimacy that they crave and deserve.  There’s more information in the premium reports to help with this process.</p>
