            <div class="step6-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Greatest Challenge</h2>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/success.png">
                <p>Awareness is always the first step to healing or reconciliation.If a Lover can understand and accept their hidden self and the reasons behind why they might do, or experience the things they do, then they start to uncover why they allow their esteem to be built (and destroyed by others).&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Which subsequently allows the Lover to find a way to build something that is indestructible.</p>
                <p>As a Lover starts to build on their sense of esteem, they learn the coping strategies to help them handle rejection in a way that doesn&rsquo;t steal their confidence. The experiences that Lovers will have in all of their close relationships, romantic or otherwise will be on a whole new level.</p>
                <p>The Lover and those who happen to be around them at that time will benefit greatly from the Lovers loving prowess, combined with their innate confidence that exudes charisma.This means that the Lovers goals for bringing love and intimacy into the world as a way of making it a better place will have just increased tenfold!&nbsp;</p>
                <p>All it takes to get started on building the Lover up inside is for The Lover to accept and acknowledge all of themselves (even the parts that they are avoiding or repressing), then they can work out strategies for helping them grow in a healthy and balanced manner. They can learn more about how to do this in the Premium Archetype Reports.&nbsp;</p>
                <p><strong>How The Lover Archetype Can Master Their Greatest Challenge</strong></p>
                <p>Few archetypes will ever experience emotion as a Lover does - it&rsquo;s their forte. The Lovers commitment to helping others to embrace and experience the colorful, emotional world that the Lover experiences is unmatched.It&rsquo;s also a much-valued way that the Lover makes a difference in the world.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>Lovers help people to stay in touch with their feelings, and when the Lover can learn to do that for themselves too, the world will be even better off for having the Lover archetype living amongst us.&nbsp;</p>
                <p>However, for most Lovers, they will continue to try to fill the never-ending emptiness inside through their skill of connecting with others, not realizing that they need to connect and get intimate with themselves to satisfy themselves.</p>
                <p>When a Lover Archetype can face the challenges that are presented to them, and they can learn that they are enough. They begin to create a harmonious and balanced life where they get to love themselves, express love and be loved in every way that they imagined.&nbsp;</p>
